{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "3e7d1a5c-8b2f-4c9e-a6d0-7f1b2c3d0021",
    "name": "MacroFit · Weights",
    "description": "Módulo de registro de peso (src/routes/weights.rs). Depende de \"auth\" solo para {{coach_access_token}} (peticiones 02 y 03), así que debe ejecutarse después de ese módulo; cada ejecución registra sus propias cuentas.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "HU-21 Registro de peso",
      "description": "HU-21: POST y GET /api/v1/users/me/weights (RF-17). La fecha la pone el servidor, el rango es el del perfil (TEC-12) y el último peso actualiza el perfil y la meta calculada.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "00 - Preparación: registrar al usuario",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "{",
                  "    const email = \"weights.\" + Date.now() + \".\" + Math.floor(Math.random() * 1e6) + \"@macrofit.test\";",
                  "    pm.variables.set(\"email\", email);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"weights_user_email\", email);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "{",
                  "    pm.test(\"Status 201 Created\", function () {",
                  "        pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "    });",
                  "    const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"weights_user_id\", data.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Crea una cuenta nueva con rol user. Guarda su id en {{weights_user_id}}.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Usuario Peso\",\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{test_password}}\",\n  \"role\": \"user\",\n  \"privacy_accepted\": true\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
